### Aricon API — example requests (SPEC §17). Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or
### JetBrains HTTP Client. Cookies from responses are kept between requests, so log in first.
### Swagger UI with every endpoint and schema: http://localhost:4000/api/docs (development only).

@api = http://localhost:4000/api
@origin = http://localhost:3000

### Health (literal body from SPEC §7.2; 503 when the database is down)
GET {{api}}/health

### ── Customer auth ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Sign up (always a CUSTOMER; sets aricon_at + aricon_rt cookies)
POST {{api}}/auth/signup
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ahmed Raza",
  "email": "ahmed@example.com",
  "phone": "0300 1234567",
  "password": "Cement2026",
  "companyName": "Raza Builders"
}

### Log in with email or mobile number (any format)
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identifier": "0300 1234567", "password": "Cement2026" }

### The signed-in customer
GET {{api}}/auth/me

### New access token (rotates the refresh token)
POST {{api}}/auth/refresh
Origin: {{origin}}

### Log out (always 204)
POST {{api}}/auth/logout
Origin: {{origin}}

### Forgot password (same answer whether or not the email exists; the link is logged in development)
POST {{api}}/auth/forgot-password
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ahmed@example.com" }

### Reset password with the token from the link
POST {{api}}/auth/reset-password
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "paste-the-43-character-token-here-xxxxxxxxx", "password": "NewCement2027" }

### ── Catalog (public, active data only) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Paste real ids/slugs from the responses into these variables.
@productSlug = lucky-opc-cement
@categorySlug = cement-plaster
@productId = 000000000000000000000000
@variantId = 000000000000000000000000
@areaId = 000000000000000000000000
@addressId = 000000000000000000000000
@orderNumber = ARC-2026-000001

### Homepage: banners, category tiles, featured, deals, new arrivals, brands
GET {{api}}/home

### Category tree with active-product counts
GET {{api}}/categories

### One category with sub-categories and breadcrumbs
GET {{api}}/categories/{{categorySlug}}

### Active brands
GET {{api}}/brands

### Listing with filters, sorting and facets (each facet ignores its own filter)
GET {{api}}/products?category={{categorySlug}}&brand=lucky-cement,dg-cement&packSize=50%20kg&minPrice=400&maxPrice=2000&inStock=true&sort=price_asc&page=1&pageSize=20

### Search listing (full text on name and brand)
GET {{api}}/products?q=cement&sort=relevance

### Product page (active variants only)
GET {{api}}/products/{{productSlug}}

### Related products (hand-picked, else same category; max 8)
GET {{api}}/products/{{productSlug}}/related

### Search-as-you-type (≥ 2 characters)
GET {{api}}/search/suggest?q=luc

### ── Store ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Delivery areas with the fee each one charges
GET {{api}}/delivery-areas

### Contact details, payment methods, COD limit, bank accounts
GET {{api}}/settings/public

### Content page by URL slug (about, faq, contact, refund-policy, delivery-policy, privacy-policy, terms)
GET {{api}}/pages/refund-policy

### ── Cart ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Guest cart quote (no login): prices a localStorage cart, with a delivery estimate
POST {{api}}/cart/quote
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [{ "productId": "{{productId}}", "variantId": "{{variantId}}", "qty": 12 }], "areaId": "{{areaId}}" }

### The customer's cart (log in first)
GET {{api}}/cart?areaId={{areaId}}

### Set a line's quantity (0 removes it)
PUT {{api}}/cart/items?areaId={{areaId}}
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "variantId": "{{variantId}}", "qty": 10 }

### Remove a line
DELETE {{api}}/cart/items/{{variantId}}
Origin: {{origin}}

### Merge the guest cart after login (quantities added, capped at stock)
POST {{api}}/cart/merge
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [{ "productId": "{{productId}}", "variantId": "{{variantId}}", "qty": 5 }] }

### ── Account (customer) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Update profile (companyName: null clears it)
PATCH {{api}}/account/profile
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ahmed Raza", "phone": "0300 1234567", "companyName": "Raza Builders" }

### Change password (other devices are signed out)
POST {{api}}/account/change-password
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "Cement2026", "newPassword": "Plaster2027" }

### Saved addresses
GET {{api}}/account/addresses

### Add an address (max 10; the first becomes the default). Answers with the whole list.
POST {{api}}/account/addresses
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "Site – Gulshan",
  "contactName": "Ahmed Raza",
  "phone": "0300 1234567",
  "line1": "Plot 12, Block 5",
  "landmark": "Near Maskan Chowrangi",
  "areaId": "{{areaId}}"
}

### Replace an address
PATCH {{api}}/account/addresses/{{addressId}}
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "label": "Home", "contactName": "Ahmed Raza", "phone": "0300 1234567", "line1": "House 7, Street 3", "areaId": "{{areaId}}", "isDefault": true }

### Make an address the default
POST {{api}}/account/addresses/{{addressId}}/default
Origin: {{origin}}

### Delete an address
DELETE {{api}}/account/addresses/{{addressId}}
Origin: {{origin}}

### ── Orders (customer) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Place an order from the cart. Use a NEW UUID v4 per checkout; resending the same key returns the
### same order (200). expectedTotal = the total shown at checkout (else 409 PRICE_CHANGED).
POST {{api}}/orders
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 3b241101-e2bb-4255-8caf-4136c566a962

{ "addressId": "{{addressId}}", "paymentMethod": "COD", "customerNote": "Call at the gate.", "expectedTotal": 5480 }

### Your orders, newest first
GET {{api}}/orders?page=1&pageSize=20

### One of your orders
GET {{api}}/orders/{{orderNumber}}

### Cancel while the order is new (stock is returned)
POST {{api}}/orders/{{orderNumber}}/cancel
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Ordered the wrong size." }

### Put a past order's items back in the cart
POST {{api}}/orders/{{orderNumber}}/reorder
Origin: {{origin}}

### Upload a bank-transfer receipt (JPG/PNG/WebP/PDF up to 5 MB; 10/hour). Put a file next to this one.
POST {{api}}/orders/{{orderNumber}}/receipts
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="receipt.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./receipt.pdf
--boundary--

### Invoice PDF for one of your orders
GET {{api}}/orders/{{orderNumber}}/invoice

### ── Company website inquiries ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Cross-origin from RFP_CORS_ORIGINS only; emailed to settings.rfpEmail, not stored. 5/hour.
POST {{api}}/public/rfp
Origin: https://aricon.com.pk
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Raza Builders",
  "contactPerson": "Ahmed Raza",
  "email": "ahmed@razabuilders.pk",
  "phone": "0300 1234567",
  "service": "Structural design",
  "brief": "Four-storey commercial building; need design and supervision.",
  "website": ""
}

### ── Staff auth ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Create the first admin: pnpm --filter api seed:admin -- --email admin@aricon.com.pk --password 'Admin2026x'

### Staff login (sets aricon_admin_at + aricon_admin_rt)
POST {{api}}/admin/auth/login
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@aricon.com.pk", "password": "Admin2026x" }

### Signed-in staff member with effective permissions
GET {{api}}/admin/auth/me

### Change own password (clears a forced change; signs out other logins)
POST {{api}}/admin/auth/change-password
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "Admin2026x", "newPassword": "Admin2027y" }

### Staff refresh (12-hour absolute limit)
POST {{api}}/admin/auth/refresh
Origin: {{origin}}

### Staff logout
POST {{api}}/admin/auth/logout
Origin: {{origin}}

### ═══ Admin API (log in as staff above first; every route needs a permission or ADMIN) ═════════
@adminProductId = 000000000000000000000000
@adminVariantId = 000000000000000000000000
@adminOrderId = 000000000000000000000000
@receiptId = 000000000000000000000000
@staffId = 000000000000000000000000
@customerId = 000000000000000000000000
@riderId = 000000000000000000000000
@categoryId = 000000000000000000000000
@brandId = 000000000000000000000000

### Dashboard (only the widgets you may see)
GET {{api}}/admin/dashboard

### Permission catalog, presets and dependencies (any staff)
GET {{api}}/admin/permissions

### ── Orders ──
### List with filters; `statusCounts` gives the tab counts
GET {{api}}/admin/orders?status=NEW,CONFIRMED&paymentMethod=COD&from=2026-09-01&to=2026-09-30&q=0300&sort=createdAt:desc&page=1&pageSize=20

### One order
GET {{api}}/admin/orders/{{adminOrderId}}

### Move along the status table (CANCELLED/RETURNED need orders.cancel and a reason)
POST {{api}}/admin/orders/{{adminOrderId}}/status
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "to": "CONFIRMED", "note": "Called the customer" }

### Assign a rider (needed before DISPATCHED)
POST {{api}}/admin/orders/{{adminOrderId}}/rider
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "riderId": "{{riderId}}" }

### Record COD cash (a different amount needs a note)
POST {{api}}/admin/orders/{{adminOrderId}}/cod-collected
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 5480 }

### A 10-minute link to a receipt file
GET {{api}}/admin/orders/{{adminOrderId}}/receipts/{{receiptId}}/url

### Invoice PDF
GET {{api}}/admin/orders/{{adminOrderId}}/invoice

### The filtered orders as Excel (same filters as the list)
GET {{api}}/admin/orders/export?status=NEW,CONFIRMED&from=2026-09-01&to=2026-09-30

### Approve / reject a bank-transfer receipt
POST {{api}}/admin/orders/{{adminOrderId}}/receipts/{{receiptId}}/approve
Origin: {{origin}}

###
POST {{api}}/admin/orders/{{adminOrderId}}/receipts/{{receiptId}}/reject
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "The amount on the receipt does not match the order total." }

### Staff-only note
PATCH {{api}}/admin/orders/{{adminOrderId}}/internal-note
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "internalNote": "Gate code 4411" }

### ── Products and stock ──
GET {{api}}/admin/products?q=cement&status=all&lowStock=true&sort=updatedAt:desc

### Upload a product photo (stored 300/800/1600 px). Leave productId out for a new product: the
### answer's productId is then sent as "id" when creating it.
POST {{api}}/admin/uploads/product-image
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="productId"

{{adminProductId}}
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="photo.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./photo.jpg
--boundary--

### Excel: products (template columns), the import template, an import and its progress
GET {{api}}/admin/products/export?status=all

###
GET {{api}}/admin/products/import-template

###
POST {{api}}/admin/products/import
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="products.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./products.xlsx
--boundary--

###
GET {{api}}/admin/import-jobs/{{importJobId}}

###
GET {{api}}/admin/products/{{adminProductId}}

### Create (initial stock needs products.edit_stock)
POST {{api}}/admin/products
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lucky OPC Cement",
  "brandId": "{{brandId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "type": "OPC",
  "unit": "bag",
  "status": "hidden",
  "variants": [
    {
      "sku": "LUCKY-OPC-50",
      "label": "50 kg bag",
      "options": { "packSize": "50 kg" },
      "mrp": 450,
      "price": 425,
      "bulkTiers": [{ "minQty": 10, "price": 415 }, { "minQty": 30, "price": 405 }, { "minQty": 50, "price": 395 }],
      "stock": 100
    }
  ]
}

### Edit details and variants (price fields need products.edit_price; `stock` is refused)
PATCH {{api}}/admin/products/{{adminProductId}}
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Lucky OPC Cement 53 Grade", "variants": [{ "id": "{{adminVariantId}}", "label": "50 kg bag (OPC 53)" }] }

### Add a variant (products.edit + products.edit_price)
POST {{api}}/admin/products/{{adminProductId}}/variants
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "LUCKY-OPC-25", "label": "25 kg bag", "options": { "packSize": "25 kg" }, "mrp": 240, "price": 225 }

### Edit one variant
PATCH {{api}}/admin/products/{{adminProductId}}/variants/{{adminVariantId}}
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price": 420 }

### Adjust stock (the only manual way; never below 0)
POST {{api}}/admin/products/{{adminProductId}}/stock-adjustments
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "variantId": "{{adminVariantId}}", "change": -3, "reason": "Damaged bags returned to supplier" }

### Show / hide / archive
POST {{api}}/admin/products/{{adminProductId}}/status
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "active" }

### Stock history
GET {{api}}/admin/stock-movements?productId={{adminProductId}}&reason=ADJUST&from=2026-09-01

