### ── ADMIN only: staff, settings, audit log ──
GET {{api}}/admin/staff

### Add staff — the temporary password is shown once in the response
POST {{api}}/admin/staff
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Sana Malik", "email": "sana@aricon.com.pk", "role": "STAFF", "permissions": ["orders.view", "orders.update_status"] }

### Change role / permissions / status (dependencies are added; last-admin and self rules apply)
PATCH {{api}}/admin/staff/{{staffId}}
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "permissions": ["orders.cancel"] }

### New temporary password (signs them out)
POST {{api}}/admin/staff/{{staffId}}/reset-password
Origin: {{origin}}

###
GET {{api}}/admin/settings

